[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669014065","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103041#issuecomment-2669014065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103041","id":2669014065,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fFewx","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T15:37:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T15:37:33Z","body":"IME definitely should be disabled on losing focus, and it can't possibly fix #101693, it was reported on macOS. But TextEdit/LineEdit probably should have extra check to not move caret when getting IME update w/o any text to commit.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669014065/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669060847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103041#issuecomment-2669060847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103041","id":2669060847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fFqLv","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T15:54:04Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T15:55:22Z","body":"> IME definitely should be disabled on losing focus, and it can't possibly fix #101693, it was reported on macOS.\n\nTrue, but it also happens on Linux. It would fix it only for Linux. Removed.\n\nMmm, this one seemed too easy, and it worked, but I guess I've missed something else.\n\n> But TextEdit/LineEdit probably should have extra check to not move caret when getting IME update w/o any text to commit.\n\nOK. Thanks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669060847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669095606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103041#issuecomment-2669095606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103041","id":2669095606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fFyq2","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T16:06:48Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T16:06:48Z","body":"Something like this might work (untested, I'll check it tomorrow):\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/scene/gui/line_edit.cpp b/scene/gui/line_edit.cpp\r\nindex b4cad350e2..6dc73cdd88 100644\r\n--- a/scene/gui/line_edit.cpp\r\n+++ b/scene/gui/line_edit.cpp\r\n@@ -1377,6 +1377,7 @@ void LineEdit::_notification(int p_what) {\r\n \r\n \t\tcase MainLoop::NOTIFICATION_OS_IME_UPDATE: {\r\n \t\t\tif (editing) {\r\n+\t\t\t\tbool had_ime_text = !ime_text.is_empty();\r\n \t\t\t\time_text = DisplayServer::get_singleton()->ime_get_text();\r\n \t\t\t\time_selection = DisplayServer::get_singleton()->ime_get_selection();\r\n \r\n@@ -1384,8 +1385,10 @@ void LineEdit::_notification(int p_what) {\r\n \t\t\t\t\tselection_delete();\r\n \t\t\t\t}\r\n \r\n-\t\t\t\t_shape();\r\n-\t\t\t\tset_caret_column(caret_column); // Update scroll_offset.\r\n+\t\t\t\tif (!ime_text.is_empty() || had_ime_text) {\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t_shape();\r\n+\t\t\t\t\tset_caret_column(caret_column); // Update scroll_offset.\r\n+\t\t\t\t}\r\n \t\t\t}\r\n \t\t} break;\r\n \r\ndiff --git a/scene/gui/text_edit.cpp b/scene/gui/text_edit.cpp\r\nindex c2c0132637..56a9cb77c3 100644\r\n--- a/scene/gui/text_edit.cpp\r\n+++ b/scene/gui/text_edit.cpp\r\n@@ -1646,9 +1646,11 @@ void TextEdit::_notification(int p_what) {\r\n \t\t\t\t\tdelete_selection();\r\n \t\t\t\t}\r\n \r\n-\t\t\t\t_update_ime_text();\r\n-\t\t\t\tadjust_viewport_to_caret(0);\r\n-\t\t\t\tqueue_redraw();\r\n+\t\t\t\tif (has_ime_text() || had_ime_text) {\r\n+\t\t\t\t\t_update_ime_text();\r\n+\t\t\t\t\tadjust_viewport_to_caret(0);\r\n+\t\t\t\t\tqueue_redraw();\r\n+\t\t\t\t}\r\n \t\t\t}\r\n \t\t} break;\r\n \r\n```\r\n\r\nNot disabling IME will cause issues if there's active pre-edit string, control will think it's still in the edit process and display it. Also, might have issues when IME is activated again.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669095606/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669110273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103041#issuecomment-2669110273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103041","id":2669110273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fF2QB","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-19T16:12:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-19T16:12:06Z","body":">  testing with the composition key on Gnome\r\n\r\nComposition key is usually not complex enough to replicate full IME activity, it's better to test it with input methods like Rime or Mozc.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2669110273/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2670576135","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103041#issuecomment-2670576135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103041","id":2670576135,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fLcIH","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.co